    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Alex Franquelli</h1>
    <p>I am a writer and critic based between London and Rome. I wrote extensively in Italian for <em>Ritual</em>, Musicboom and OndaRock, alongside criticism and features in English for The Quietus, PopMatters, All About Jazz, The Line of Best Fit and openDemocracy.</p>
    <p>My work moves between music, politics and culture, in Italian and English. I also write fiction and am finishing my first novel.</p>
    <p>Alongside writing, I work in media planning and buying in London.</p>
    <p>Reading is part of the work too. You can find my books and reading activity on <a class="text-link" href="https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/8057489.Alex_Franquelli" rel="me noopener">Goodreads ↗</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
